Z||000001||Oreif||11-26-2000||11:05 PM||||Coming from someone who has an Indy scoop,<BR>I think yours would look better about an inch lower. It could just be the pic angle but it looks a tad too high. Other than that it looks good. My only question is I noticed the bottom flares out about 1/2 way down the window, How much does the scoop restrict your rear view?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
